# This template may be used as a starting point for developing
# new custom voice packs for OOTR
# All comments (anything after # on a line) will be stripped out by the patcher
{
    # Items in the "direct_bank" dictionary are patched into the game directly by their SFX Index
    # in the SFX audio bank (bank 0) 
    # This should only be used if you know what you're doing
    # Entries in this dictionary should be in the following format
    # Keys - string representation of the bank ID (base 16)
    # Values - Another dictionary of the following format:
    #   Keys - SFX ID within the bank (base 16)
    #   Values - file name within the pack
